comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-27T00:37:15.358Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check across all PM statuses: searched GH #1321, entry_limit, incomplete source scan, partial package copy, and package install. Earlier lifecycle items cover different completed fixes; no existing item owns this limit-truncation defect. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1321. Intake only; item remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-09-27T07:08:21.032Z","harness:codex","Pre-fix regression: focused SDK test returned ok=true with copy.complete=false and stop_reason=entry_limit. The same test now passes after the SDK planner refuses incomplete local directory scans before dry-run or real installation, with a stable error code and archive recovery. Direct planner remains able to report lower-bound scans."
  "2026-09-27T07:14:33.251Z","harness:codex",Generated the SDK public error-code catalog after adding extension_install_incomplete_source_scan; the generator rebalanced one existing entry across partitions without changing its contract.
  "2026-09-27T07:16:17.412Z","harness:codex",Regenerated the exact public contracts fixture for the new refusal code after the static gate correctly detected catalog drift.
  "2026-09-27T07:30:31.403Z","harness:codex","The generated refusal census now lists the new code as uncovered by its executable cross-command recovery probes, even though the focused SDK regression checks its structured code and recovery message. This is explicit scope evidence, not a claim of full recovery-census coverage."
  "2026-09-27T07:50:25.287Z","harness:codex","Manual temporary-project proof (2026-09-27): initialized isolated PM_PATH/PM_GLOBAL_PATH; SDK maxEntries=1 and CLI default maxDepth=64 refused local source with extension_install_incomplete_source_scan in both dry-run and real modes; no destination created. npm pack --ignore-scripts --json then pm package install <archive> --project activated the package and installed index.js. First proof script only misparsed npm 11 object-shaped pack JSON; corrected parser and full proof passed."
  "2026-09-27T08:36:11.973Z","harness:codex","Verification: linked focused test passed 2/2 in sandbox; full repository coverage passed 9,373 tests and exact 100/100/100/100; packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx smoke passed across nine packages; manual isolated project proved no partial destination and archive recovery. pnpm audit found zero advisories. Static aggregate advanced past contracts, docstrings, lint, duplicate checks, tracker gate and SDK surface before an unchanged-entrypoint timing overrun; its isolated import gate passed on retry. Graph, record-integrity and mutation gates passed separately. Hosted exact-head CI remains the release gate."
  "2026-09-27T08:36:20.713Z","harness:codex","Correction to preceding verification note: the aggregate static script stopped at SDK import timing; a separate run of its subsequent CLI transport-floor gate also exceeded local host latency ceilings (context/next/create/claim), while host load average was about 7. Both timing gates await hosted CI verdict. All non-timing static stages reached so far passed."
